{"game": "lort", "language": "english", "appid": 2956680, "month": "2026-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1779580800, "end_date": 1780271999, "month_true_total": 108, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 15:04:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "226893434", "author": {"steamid": "76561198834224763", "personaname": "ethan150", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198834224763/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 579, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 336, "last_played": 1780717774, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "Where to start while the game is fun i feel like the 3 day time limit really limits the time i get to enjoy the small details around the map. the rush to power up feels to rushed each mission.  i do wish we could store weapon's if we complete a mission with it and make it back to camp and make it a permanent starting weapon at the cost of not being able to use it until the current run is done.\n\nthe coin to chest ratio feels far to  low and the enemy to camp ratio is a bit high especially in the second area where the invisible goblins are just a constant annoyance.  i think in a multiplayer setting being able to drop the booster items would be a nice touch \n\nfun game i do hope to see some QoL changes", "timestamp_created": 1780257114, "timestamp_updated": 1780257114, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.583333313465118408", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226817914", "author": {"steamid": "76561199199601852", "personaname": "Smaczny_Kurczak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HotWetFartSlave/", "num_games_owned