ew": 237, "last_played": 1788757935, "avatar": "a4c079c46ccce584d7d5ebe4e107dd00efe7bbd0"}, "language": "english", "review": "RISK OF RAIN 3?! SAY LESS!", "timestamp_created": 1780120424, "timestamp_updated": 1780120424, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1769006794", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226731210", "author": {"steamid": "76561199882314309", "personaname": "Grizmog", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199882314309/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 701, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 701, "last_played": 1780085434, "avatar": "8dae61291da5b5a21b1df51bd3d0c9eab35b1989"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's pretty fun, and while I'd recommend it just because I love these types of games, it is evident at this point that they have a long way to go to make it as replayable as other titles in the genre. I beat my first run on normal after 11.7 hours, and strangely I'd be satisfied putting down the game. There are only two mission types, and the old man in the lobby is annoy af. I'd come back to the lobby heated after doing well and then very suddenly dying to some random CC (that frankly too many mobs can use) and I'd have to hear his stupid voice. I absolutely do not enjoy hearing the same handful of semi-annoying phrases vomited at me over and over, and it drove me to play mostly without my headphones. That said: I think there's a lot of potential in this game; I hope it gets the love it deserves to make it great.", "timestamp_created": 1780092102, "timestamp_updated": 1780092339, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.620253145694732666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received